# ==================== 换行符统一 ====================
# 仓库内与工作区一律 LF，不受各机器 core.autocrlf 影响。
# 本机 core.autocrlf=true，若不锁定，checkout 时会被转成 CRLF，
# 之后每次改动都产生整文件 diff 噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ==================== 显式声明文本文件 ====================
*.py        text eol=lf
*.pyi       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.toml      text eol=lf
*.cfg       text eol=lf
*.ini       text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.csv       text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
.gitignore  text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf

# ==================== 二进制文件（禁止任何转换） ====================
*.bin       binary
*.gguf      binary
*.safetensors binary
*.sqlite    binary
*.db        binary
*.nsys-rep  binary
*.qdrep     binary
*.pdf       binary
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.ico       binary
*.so        binary
*.dll       binary
*.dylib     binary
*.exe       binary
*.pyc       binary

# ==================== 语言统计（GitHub Linguist） ====================
# 把运行产物排除出语言占比统计；tests/data/ 是示例测量数据，照常统计
modeling/outputs/**   linguist-generated
